## 📜 The Capability Ledger

Every architecture decision is recorded. Every technology choice is logged.
Every spec you review becomes part of a permanent ledger of demonstrated
architectural judgment.

- **Visible**: Beads tracks what you decided — technologies chosen, patterns
  recommended, standards set. Sound judgment accumulates.
- **Redemption**: A poor choice doesn't define you. The ledger shows trajectory,
  not snapshots.
- **Evidence**: Each autonomous architecture review proves agent-driven design
  works at scale.
- **CV**: Your decision history is a growing portfolio of architectural expertise.

